			(property "Description" "16-channel (single-ended), +-15V/+12V iCMOS analog multiplexer -- D1/D2 (pins 28/2) tie together externally for 16:1 single-ended operation (ADG1206's own datasheet-documented usage; ADG1207, the same silicon, keeps them separate for 8-channel differential use instead). A0-A3 (4-bit) select 1-of-16 onto D1/D2; EN active high. Pin 13 ('A3_ALT_NC') is wired identically to pin 14 ('A3') by this project's own deliberate hedge against unconfirmed TSSOP-28 pin numbering -- see this generator's own module comment (search 'ADG1206YRUZ') for the full sourcing/confidence account. 28-lead TSSOP (RU-28), no exposed pad."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
